                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Love Letter\"] お元気ですか？私は 元気ですMemories are, for the lack of a better word, strange. While the facts and chronology stay unchanged, one can feel differently or discover something new in the process of remembering the past. Memories can often be a source of sadness and regrets, especially when death becomes one of the facts. But we live on memories. We need them to go forward, to grow and to be.",
