                                   "snippet":  "\"The Love Letter\" revolves around Helen MacFarquhar (Kate Capshaw), an attractive divorced woman in her 40s who runs a local bookstore and spends her spare hours jogging. Helen, who fields irritated phone calls from an ex-husband who complains about having to pay for everything, lives a life of contented celibacy.",
